      "value": "(i) The temperature at the end of compressor,"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(ii) Work done in compressing the gas,"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(iii) Decrease in internal energy, and"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(iv) Heat given out by the gas."
    },
    {
